@startuml
title Bedside station v1 state machine

[*] --> Booting
Booting --> idle : WiFi, NTP and audio ready\nno enabled alarm
Booting --> armed : valid enabled alarm loaded
Booting --> fault : blocking fault

idle --> armed : enabled alarm loaded
idle --> fault : time/config/audio fault

armed --> idle : alarm disabled
armed --> ringing : local alarm time reached\nbracelet ready
armed --> idle : 15-minute activity window expired\nor revision already completed
armed --> fault : no valid time/config\nbracelet missing/low/fault

ringing --> validating_activity : bracelet movement present\nXSMT LOW, stream continues
ringing --> stopped : 15-minute activity window ended
ringing --> fault : audio fault or bracelet timeout

validating_activity --> ringing : bracelet movement absent\nXSMT HIGH, same audio continues
validating_activity --> stopped : 15-minute activity window ended
validating_activity --> fault : bracelet/audio fault

stopped --> idle : alarm cycle complete

fault --> idle : problem fixed\nno enabled alarm
fault --> armed : problem fixed\nvalid enabled alarm

note right of ringing
Supabase track playback failure does not stop alarm.
The station switches to generated local fallback audio.
Periodic config refresh does not leave ringing
or validating_activity.
Network status refreshes are deferred while
streaming remote audio to avoid underruns.
end note

note bottom
There is no normal stop or snooze transition.
Bracelet movement only mutes audio during the
fixed 15-minute activity window by toggling XSMT.
The stream or fallback audio keeps running until
the station marks the alarm complete when that
window ends.
end note

@enduml
